                                                                        <p>Major global search algorithms utilize page velocity and real-world user interface performance - commonly referred to as Core Web Vitals - as a critical ranking milestone. Platforms that suffer from long script-loading freezes face heavy structural demotions in search layouts, whereas ultra-fast loading systems secure premier visibility positions because they provide a superior consumer experience.</p>
